{
  "form": {
    "version": 1,
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "general",
        "label": {
          "zh-CN": "通用",
          "en-US": "General"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh-CN": "管理渠道接入与审批方式。",
          "en-US": "Manage channel access and approvals."
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "path": ["enabled"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "启用渠道网关",
              "en-US": "Enable channel gateway"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": true
          },
          {
            "path": ["defaultApprovalMode"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "会话审批模式",
              "en-US": "Session approval mode"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "options": ["agent", "always_ask", "full_access"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "agent": {
                "zh-CN": "Guardrail 自动",
                "en-US": "Guardrail auto"
              },
              "always_ask": {
                "zh-CN": "每次询问",
                "en-US": "Always ask"
              },
              "full_access": {
                "zh-CN": "完全自主",
                "en-US": "Full access"
              }
            },
            "required": false,
            "essential": true
          }
        ],
        "documentation": {
          "zh-CN": "### 接入后的对话\n\n在对应平台启用机器人后，渠道消息会进入 Senera 会话。主控台可以查看执行轨迹；平台侧的发言、文件和其他操作由当前渠道提供的工具完成。\n\n### 先设置，再连接\n\n先开启渠道总开关，再进入平台配置凭据并连接。审批方式决定工具操作何时需要确认；它不改变工作区与工具本身的访问权限。",
          "en-US": "### Conversations across channels\n\nConnected platform messages enter Senera sessions. Inspect execution in the console; platform messages, files and actions use the tools exposed for the current channel.\n\n### Configure, then connect\n\nEnable the gateway, configure each platform and connect. Approval mode controls when tool actions need confirmation; workspace and tool permissions still apply."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "telegram",
        "label": {
          "zh-CN": "Telegram",
          "en-US": "Telegram"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh-CN": "通过 Telegram 机器人接收消息、开展对话。",
          "en-US": "Chat through a Telegram bot."
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "enabled"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "启用",
              "en-US": "Enabled"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": true
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "token"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "Bot Token",
              "en-US": "Bot Token"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "secret": true,
            "required": false,
            "essential": true
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "mode"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "接收模式",
              "en-US": "Receive mode"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "options": ["long_polling", "webhook"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "long_polling": {
                "zh-CN": "长轮询（默认）",
                "en-US": "Long polling (default)"
              },
              "webhook": {
                "zh-CN": "Webhook",
                "en-US": "Webhook"
              }
            },
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "webhookUrl"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "Webhook 地址",
              "en-US": "Webhook URL"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "webhookSecret"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "Webhook 密钥",
              "en-US": "Webhook secret"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "secret": true,
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "allowedUsers"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "允许的用户 ID",
              "en-US": "Allowed user IDs"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "itemType": "string",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "allowAllUsers"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "允许所有用户（慎用）",
              "en-US": "Allow all users (use with care)"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "homeChannelId"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "默认投递频道 ID",
              "en-US": "Home channel ID"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "allowedRoles"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "允许的角色（预留）",
              "en-US": "Allowed roles (reserved)"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "itemType": "string",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "requireMention"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "群聊需要提及",
              "en-US": "Require mention in groups"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "groupSessionsPerUser"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "群聊按用户隔离会话",
              "en-US": "Group sessions per user"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "streamProgress"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "发送工具进度提示",
              "en-US": "Send tool progress hints"
            },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          },
          {
            "path": ["telegram", "maxMessageLength"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "消息长度上限",
              "en-US": "Max message length"
            },
            "type": "number",
            "min": 1,
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          }
        ],
        "documentation": {
          "zh-CN": "### 创建并连接机器人\n\n在 Telegram 的 @BotFather 创建机器人，将获得的 Token 填入配置。默认的长轮询方式可直接使用，无需公网域名。配置允许接入的用户或会话后，在此页面连接。\n\n### 使用方式\n\n打开机器人私聊发送消息，或将机器人加入群组。可用的消息格式、编辑和交互操作以当前渠道工具为准，执行情况会在主控台同步展示。\n\n如果需要由平台主动推送事件，可配置公开 HTTPS 地址并使用 webhook；不需要为普通本地使用额外配置它。",
          "en-US": "### Create and connect a bot\n\nCreate a bot with @BotFather and enter its token. Long polling works without a public domain. Configure allowed users or conversations, then connect here.\n\n### Start a conversation\n\nMessage the bot privately or add it to a group. The current channel tools define supported message formats and operations; execution remains visible in the console.\n\nWebhook delivery is available with a public HTTPS endpoint. It is optional for local use."
        }
      },
