              "en-US": "Media token cache TTL"
            },
            "type": "number",
            "min": 1000,
            "required": false,
            "essential": false,
            "durationUnit": "milliseconds"
          },
          {
            "path": ["qq", "typingDebounceMs"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "输入提示刷新间隔",
              "en-US": "Typing refresh interval"
            },
            "type": "number",
            "min": 1000,
            "required": false,
            "essential": false,
            "durationUnit": "milliseconds"
          }
        ],
        "documentation": {
          "zh-CN": "### 连接 QQ 开放平台\n\n在 QQ 开放平台创建机器人，填写 AppID 和 AppSecret，并确认账号已获准使用对应的私聊、群聊或频道能力。默认使用 WebSocket 接收事件。\n\n### 在 QQ 中使用\n\n通过平台允许的入口向机器人发送消息。模型使用 QQ 专用工具发送文字、媒体与交互内容，主控台保留执行过程。可发送的内容、主动消息次数和使用范围受到 QQ 开放平台的权限约束。\n\n### 语音与高级连接设置\n\n语音转写需要单独配置兼容的转写服务。超时、媒体缓存和事件接收方式位于下方高级设置；普通使用无需修改它们。",
          "en-US": "### Connect QQ open platform\n\nCreate a bot, enter its AppID and AppSecret, and enable the required direct, group or guild permissions. Events use WebSocket by default.\n\n### Chat in QQ\n\nMessage the bot through an allowed platform entry point. The model uses QQ tools for text, media and interactions while execution stays visible in the console. Platform permissions govern content, proactive messages and audience.\n\n### Speech and connection settings\n\nSpeech transcription requires a separately configured compatible service. Advanced settings control timeouts, media caching and event delivery."
        }
      },
