          {
            "path": ["discord", "allowedRoles"],
            "label": {
              "zh-CN": "允许的角色 ID",
              "en-US": "Allowed role IDs"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "itemType": "string",
            "required": false,
            "essential": false
          }
        ],
        "documentation": {
          "zh-CN": "### 添加到服务器\n\n在 Discord Developer Portal 创建应用和机器人，填写 Bot Token，开启所需的消息访问权限。通过安装链接将机器人加入服务器，并授予目标频道的读取与发言权限。\n\n### 对话与连接\n\n在允许的私信或频道中发消息即可进入 Senera 会话。消息呈现遵循 Discord 的格式与限制；当前可用操作由渠道工具声明。连接断开后会尝试恢复网关会话，连接状态可在这里查看。",
          "en-US": "### Add a bot to your server\n\nCreate an application and bot in Discord Developer Portal, enter its bot token and enable the required message permissions. Install it in a server with permission to read and send in the intended channels.\n\n### Conversations and connection\n\nMessages from allowed direct conversations or channels enter Senera sessions. Discord formatting and limits apply, and channel tools declare available operations. The gateway can resume its session after reconnection."
        }
